- - New case `phoenicia.Font.Error.Reason.TruncatedTable(tag: Sfnt.Table.Tag)`, numbered 11:
-   `Sfnt#head` and `Sfnt#hhea` raise a `Font.Error` with it when the table is shorter than its fixed
-   layout; they previously threw `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException`. An exhaustive match on
